# API conventions

Laravel 12 app. Routes: `routes/api.php`. Controllers: `app/Http/Controllers`. Domain logic: `app/Services`.

- Session identity is the `user` cookie (ITS number), resolved by `user.from.cookie` (`ResolveUserFromCookie`). Not Bearer tokens.
- Put new endpoints in `routes/api.php`. Keep `{id}` routes after static path segments (`active`, `search`, etc.).
- `users.user_type` is removed. Roles live on `user_role`; sharaf visibility on `user_sharaf_type`.
- Role **Master** is the Bhaisaheb (BS) role in the frontend.
- When adding a feature, update the matching frontend types in `src/types/api.ts` and client in `src/services/api.ts` (sibling repo).
- Do not commit `.env`, `vendor/`, SQL dumps (`backup_*.sql`, `miqaat_api.sql`), or `graphify-out/`.

Graph: `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md`. Rebuild after large `app/` or `routes/` changes with `/graphify app --update`.
